<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Design Tokens</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            /* Color Tokens */
            --primary-color: #2563eb;
            --secondary-color: #1e40af;
            --accent-color: #10b981;
            --background-color: #f8fafc;
            --card-color: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #333333;
            --muted-color: #64748b;

            /* Spacing Tokens */
            --spacing-small: 8px;
            --spacing-medium: 16px;
            --spacing-large: 24px;

            /* Typography Tokens */
            --font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            --font-size-small: 14px;
            --font-size-medium: 16px;
            --font-size-large: 28px;

            /* Other Design Tokens */
            --border-radius: 10px;
            --shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-family);
            background-color: var(--background-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--card-color);
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-large);
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: var(--font-size-large);
        }

        main {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: var(--spacing-large) auto;
            padding: var(--spacing-medium);
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-color);
            padding: var(--spacing-large);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-large);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .accent {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--card-color);
            padding: var(--spacing-small) var(--spacing-large);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        footer {
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            color: var(--card-color);
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-medium);
            font-size: var(--font-size-small);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Design Tokens Demo</h1>
        <p>Consistent Design Using CSS Variables</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="card">
            <h2>What Are Design Tokens?</h2>
            <p>
                Design tokens are reusable values that store design
                decisions such as colors, spacing, fonts, and border radius.
            </p>
            <p class="accent">
                They help maintain a consistent design across a website.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Color Tokens</h2>
            <p>Primary color: Blue</p>
            <p>Secondary color: Dark Blue</p>
            <p>Accent color: Green</p>
            <p>Background color: Light Gray</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Spacing and Typography</h2>
            <p>Small spacing: 8px</p>
            <p>Medium spacing: 16px</p>
            <p>Large spacing: 24px</p>
            <p>Font family: Arial</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Reusable Button</h2>
            <p>This button uses the same design tokens as the page.</p>
            <a href="#top" class="button">Learn More</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Design Tokens Demo</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>